  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 180\u00b0C / 350\u00b0F.",
    "Mix flour, baking powder, sweetener and salt. Melt butter 20 seconds microwave. Add yogurt and melted butter; combine into a dough ball.",
    "Mix cream cheese, cinnamon, brown sugar and casein into a creamy filling.",
    "Roll dough flat on a board into a rectangle. Spread filling; roll upward into a log; cut into 6\u20138 rolls.",
    "Place in a parchment-lined dish; bake 20 minutes. Lasts 3\u20134 days in fridge."
